## SQ-AV-01 | /recipe give learns nothing; the book stays empty
@group A
@commands Fake player: `/recipe give rbk1 *`, then `/recipe give rbk1 minecraft:furnace`, then `/recipe take rbk1 *`
@pass both gives answer "No new recipes were learned"; the take answers "No recipes could be forgotten" (nothing was added); boot log has no mixin error naming NoRecipeUnlockMixin
@fails mixin not applied (`bootexpect` on creativecommon.mixins.json, the SRG names m_7281_ / m_7902_), or Common older than 2026-11-17
> pbot spawn rbk1 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> recipe give rbk1 *
waitlog No new recipes were learned 20
> recipe give rbk1 minecraft:furnace
sleep 2
count No new recipes were learned >= 2
> recipe take rbk1 *
waitlog No recipes could be forgotten 20
reject Unlocked \d+ recipes? for
bootreject NoRecipeUnlockMixin.*(InvalidInjectionException|could not find|failed)
> pbot remove rbk1
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player)|\[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=))

