## CQ-AV-01 | furnace smelt: XP drops, recipe book gains nothing, no toast
@group client
@commands Fresh player (empty recipe book): smelt raw iron in a furnace, take the iron ingot by hand; open the recipe book
@pass XP orbs or the XP bar rise as before; no "New Recipes Unlocked" toast; the recipe book's furnace tab shows nothing new (no red "new" marks)
@fails toast shows: another unlock path (a mod calling ServerRecipeBook.addRecipes directly, grep its mixins); no XP: the mixin hit the XP pop (it must only cancel the award)
@draft no driver step fills a furnace and takes its output slot by hand yet; owner LOOK
## CQ-AV-02 | crafting table: crafting unlocks nothing
@group client
@commands Fresh player: craft sticks, a crafting table and a furnace by hand; open the recipe book
@pass no toast; the recipe book shows no newly unlocked recipe after the crafts
@fails as CQ-AV-01
@draft no driver step crafts in a grid yet; owner LOOK
